### Page content (from check + KS CSS)

- **Purpose:** PDCA tied to `det-motion-prefers-reduced.check.js` — emulates `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`, flags animations/transitions **> 0.02s**, autoplay video, SVG SMIL; allows essential motion (`spinner`, `loading`, `aria-busy`, etc.).
- **Pass/fail signals:** References real KS surfaces — `.pulse`, `.pulse-amber`, `.breathe-link`, `.breathe-static`, `.forge-card`, `.ks-tilt-inner`, `.ks-living-drift-layer`, `.ks-sa-root`, `.fa-css-shimmer`.
- **Before/after HTML:** Uses `doc-main`, `forge-section`, `glass-amber`, `glass`, `bento-grid`, `forge-card`, `forge-diagram`, `ks-diagram-card`, `section-label`, `forge-support`, `card-label`, `stat-value`, Bootstrap `.spinner-border`.
- **Evidence:** Documents `motionPrefersReducedReport` fields and violation kinds (`active-animation`, `active-transition`, `autoplay-video`, `smil-animation`).

